{
  "title": "al-Isteghasa الکامل التام",
  "code": "012",
  "data": "In his book of al-Kalim al-Tayyib, Sayyid Ali Khan says, “The following is a form of seeking aid from Imam-e-Zamana (a.t.f.s.): Wherever you are, you may offer a two-unit prayer, reading Surah al-Faatehah and any other one in each unit. Yet, it is advisable to read Surah al-Fath (No. 48) in the first unit and Surah al-Nasr (No. 110) in the second. \nYou may stand up, facing the qiblah under the sky and then say the following:\nسَلَامُ اللهِ الْكَامِلُ التَّامُّ الشَّامِلُ الْعَآمُّ\nSALAAMUL LAAHIL KAAMELUT TAAM-MUSH SHAAMELUL A'AAM-MO\nThe most perfect, complete, all-embracing and general salutations \nوَ صَلَوَاتُهُ الدَّآئِمَةُ\nWA SALAWAATOHUD DAAA-EMATO\nand His continuous blessings \nوَ بَرَكَاتُهُ الْقَآئِمَةُ التَّآمَّةُ\nWA BARAKAATOHUL QAAA-EMATUT TAAAM-MATO\nand His established and all-encompassing grace \nعَلٰى حُجَّةِ اللهِ\nA’LAA HUJJATIL LAAHE\nbe upon the Proof of Allah \nوَ وَلِيِّهٖ فِىْ اَرْضِهٖ وَ بِلَادِهٖ\nWA WALIYYEHI FEE ARZEHI WA BELAADEHI\nand His vicegerent in His earth and His cities \nوَ خَلِيْفَتِهٖ عَلٰى خَلْقِهٖ وَ عِبَادِهٖ\nWA KHALEEFATEHI A’LAA KHALQEHI WA E’BAADEHI\nand His caliph upon His creation and His servants \nوَ سُلَالَةِ النُّبُوَّةِ\nWA SOLAALATIN NOBUWWATE\nand the descendant of Prophethood \nوَ بَقِيَّةِ الْعِتْرَةِ وَالصَّفْوَةِ\nWA BAQIYYATIL I’TRATE WAS-SAFWATE\nand the remnant of the lineage and the chosen one of Allah, \nصَاحِبِ الزَّمَانِ\nSAAHEBIZ ZAMAANE\nthe Master of the time \nوَ مُظْهِرِ الْاِيْمَانِ\nWA MUZHERIL EEMAANE\nand the manifestation of faith \nوَ مُلَقِّنِ اَحْكَامِ الْقُرْآنِ\nWA MOLAQQENE AHKAAMIL QUR-AAANE\nand the one who emphasises the rules of Quran \nوَ مُطَهِّرِ الْاَرْضِ\nWA MOTAHHERIL ARZE\nand the purifier of the earth \nوَ نَاشِرِ الْعَدْلِ فِىْ الطُّوْلِ وَالْعَرْضِ\nWA NAASHERIL A’DLE FIT TOOLE WAL A’RZE\nand the spreader of justice across the length and the breadth (of the earth),\nوَ الْحُجَّةِ الْقَآئِمِ الْمَهْدِىِّ\nWAL HUJJATIL QAAA-EMIL MAHDIYYE\nand the Proof, the upright, \nاَلْاِمَامِ الْمُنْتَظَرِ الْمَرْضِىِّ\nAL EMAAMIL MUNTAZARIL MARZIYYE\nthe awaited, the contended \nوَ ابْنِ الْاَئِمَّةِ الطَّاهِرِيْنَ\nWABNIL A-IMMATIT TAAHEREENA\nand the son of the purified leaders \nاَلْوَصِىِّ بْنِ الْاَوْصِيَآءِ الْمَرْضِيِّيْنَ\nAL WASIYYIBNIL AWSE-YAAA-IL MARZIYYEENA\nand the vicegerent son of the happy vicegerents, \nاَلْهَادِىْ الْمَعْصُوْمِ ابْنِ الْاَئِمَّةِ الْهُدَاةِ الْمَعْصُوْمِيْنَ \nAL HAADIL MA’SOOMIBNIL A’IMMATIL HODAATIL MA’SOOMEENA\nthe infallible and guided son of guided leaders.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا مُعِزَّ الْمُؤْمِنِيْنَ الْمُسْتَضْعَفِيْنَ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA MO-I’ZZAL MO’MENEENAL MUSTAZ-A’FEENA\nPeace be on you, O the giver of honour to the believers and the weakened ones. \nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا مُذِلَّ الْكَافِرِيْنَ الْمُتَكَبِّرِيْنَ الظَّالِمِيْنَ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA MOZILLAL KAAFEREENAL MOTAKABBEREENAZ ZAALEMEENA\nPeace be on you, O the degrader of the disbelievers and the arrogant and the oppressors.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا مَوْلَاىَ يَا صَاحِبَ الزَّمَانِ \nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA MAWLAAYA YAA SAAHEBAZ ZAMAANE\nPeace be on you, O my master, O the master of the time. \nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَابْنَ رَسُوْلِ اللهِ \nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YABNA RASOOLIL LAAHE\nPeace be on you, O the son of the Apostle of Allah, \nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَابْنَ اَمِيْرِ الْمُؤْمِنِيْنَ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YABNA AMEERIL MOMINEENA\nPeace be on you, O the son of the commander of the faithful, \nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا بْنَ فَاطِمَةَ الزَّهْرَآءِ \nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YABNA FAATEMATAZ ZAHRAAA-E \nPeace be on you, O the son of the Fatima Zahra, \nسَيِّدَةِ نِسَآءِ الْعَالَمِيْنَ\nSAYYEDATE NESAAA-IL A’ALAMEENA\nthe leader of the women of Paradise. \nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا بْنَ الْاَئِمَّةِ الْحُجَجِ الْمَعْصُوْمِيْنَ \nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YABNAL A-IMMATIL HUJAJIL MA’SOOMEENA\nPeace be on you, O the son of the infallible proofs \nوَ الْاِمَامِ عَلَى الْخَلْقِ اَجْمَعِيْنَ \nWAL EMAAME A’LAL KHALQE AJMA-E’ENA\nand the leader upon the entire creation. \nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا مَوْلَاىَ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA MAWLAAYA\nPeace be on you, O my master, \nسَلَامَ مُخْلِصٍ لَكَ فِى الْوِلَايَةِ \nSALAAMA MUKHLESAN LAKA FIL WELAAYATE\nthe salutation of one who is sincere in his friendship with you. \nاَشْهَدُ اَنَّكَ الْاِمَامُ الْمَهْدِىُّ قَوْلًا وَ فِعْلًا \nASH-HADO ANNAKAL EMAAMUL MAHDIYYO QAWLAN WA FEA’LAN\nI bear witness that you are the guided leader in word and deed \nوَ اَنْتَ الَّذِىْ تَمْلَاُ الْاَرْضَ قِسْطًا وَعَدْلًا\nWA ANTAL LAZEE TAM-LA-UL ARZA QISTAN WA A’DLAN \nand that you will fill the earth with peace and equity \n بَعْدَ مَا مُلِئَتْ ظُلْمًا وَ جَوْرًا \nBA’DA MAA MOLE-AT ZULMAN WA JAWRAN\nafter it has been filled with justice and oppression. \nفَعَجَّلَ اللهُ فَرَجَكَ\nFA-A’JJALAL LAAHO FARAJAKA\nThen, may Allah hasten your reappearance \nوَ سَهَّلَ مَخْرَجَكَ\nWA SAH-HALA MAKHRAJAKA\nand make easy your uprising \nوَ قَرَّبَ زَمَانَكَ\nWA QARRABA ZAMAANAK\nand make near your era \nوَ كَثَّرَ اَنْصَارَكَ وَ اَعْوَانَكَ\nWA KASSARA ANSAARAKA WA A-A’WAANAKA\nand augment your friends and aides \nوَ اَنْجَزَ لَكَ مَا وَعَدَكَ\nWA ANJAZA LAKA MAA WA-A’DAKA\nand fulfill for you all that He has promised you, \nفَهُوَ اَصْدَقُ الْقَآئِلِيْنَ\nFAHOWA ASDAQUL QAAA-ELEENA\nthen surely He is the most truthful (when He says) \nوَ نُرِيْدُ اَنْ نَمُنَّ عَلَى الَّذِيْنَ اسْتُضْعِفُوْا فِى الْاَرْضِ \nWA NOREEDO AN NAMUNNA A’LAL LAZEENAS TUZ-E’FOO FIL ARZE \n“And surely We intend to favour those who were deemed weak in the land \nوَ نَجْعَلَهُمْ اَئِمَّةً وَّ نَجْعَلَهُمُ الْوَارِثِيْنَ \nWA NAJ-A’LAHUM A-IMMATAN WA NAJ-A’LAHOMUL WAARESEENA\nand to make them the leaders and to make them the inheritors.”\nيَا مَوْلَاىَ يَا صَاحِبَ الزَّمَانِ\nYAA MAWLAAYA YAA SAAHEBAZ ZAMAANE \nO my master, on the master of the age, \nيَا بْنَ رَسُوْلِ اللهِ حَاجَتِىْ\nYABNA RASOOLIL LAAHE HAAJATEE\nO the son of the Apostle of Allah, my needs are.\nPray for your needs and then say:\nفَاشْفَعْ لِىْ فِىْ نَجَاحِهَا\nFASH-FA' LEE FEE NAJAAHEHA\nThen intercede for me for their fulfillment, \nفَقَدْ تَوَجَّهْتُ اِلَيْكَ بِحَاجَتِىْ\nFAQAD TAWAJJAHTO ELAYKA BE-HAAJATEE\nfor surely I have turned do you with my needs \nلِعِلْمِىْ اَنَّ لَكَ عِنْدَ اللهِ شَفَاعَةً مَقْبُوْلَةً\nLE-I'LMEE ANNA LAKA I'NDALLAAHE SHAFAA-A'TAN MAQBOOLATAN \nbecause I know that before Allah your intercession is accepted in \nوَ مَقَامًا مَحْمُوْدًا \nWA MAQAAMAN MAHMOODAN\nand you possess a praiseworthy station near Allah. \nفَبِحَقِّ مَنِ اخْتَصَّكُمْ بِاَمْرِهٖ وَارْتَضَاكُمْ لِسِرِّهٖ\nFA-BEHAQQE MANIKH TASSAKUM BE-AMREHI WAR TAZAAKUM LE-SIRREHI\nThen for the sake of the One who has chosen you for His affair and His secrets \nوَ بِالشَّانِ الَّذِىْ لَكُمْ عِنْدَ اللهِ بَيْنَكُمْ وَ بَيْنَهٗ\nWA BISH-SHANIL LAZEE LAKUM I'NDAL LAAHE BAYNAKUM WA BAYNAHU\nand by the position which you enjoy near Allah, \nسَلِ اللهَ تَعَالٰى فِىْ نُجَحِ طَلِبَتِىْ\nSALIL LAAHA TA-A'ALAA FEE NOJAHE TALEBATEE\nplease implore Allah for the success in my endeavour \nوَ اِجَابَةِ دَعْوَتِىْ\nWA EJAABATE DA'WATEE \nand the fulfillment of my prayers \nوَ كَشْفِ كُرْبَتِىْ\nWA KASHFE KURBATEE\nand the removal of my troubles.\nYou may then ask for whatever you want, and it will be settled for you, by Allah’s permission."
}
